oss-cutting. A skill can carry any number of them, and a tag can span categories — that is what lets you report on a theme the category structure does not follow.\nTags\nApplied to any number of skills\nAdd tag\nTAG\tDESCRIPTION\tSKILLS\tSTATUS\t\nTag A\tProgram-defined tag\t4\tActive\t\nEdit\nTag B\tProgram-defined tag\t4\tActive\t\nEdit\nTag C\tProgram-defined tag\t4\tActive\t\nEdit\nWhere each tag reaches\nA tag spanning several categories is doing the job a category cannot.\nTag A\n4 skills across 3 categories\nIV Insertion\nFoley Catheter Insertion\nSterile Dressing Change\nWound Care\nTag B\n4 skills across 3 categories\nIV Insertion\nHead-to-Toe Assessment\nMedication Administration\nVital Signs Assessment\nTag C\n4 skills across 2 categories\nFoley Catheter Insertion\nMedication Administration\nTracheostomy Care\nMedication Reconciliation\nEdit tag\nTags can be applied to any number of skills.\nNAME\n*\nDESCRIPTION\nSTATUS\nActive\nInactive\nCancel\nSave","tree":{"t":"div","box":[0,0,1440,900],"kids":[{"t":"div","box":[0,0,1440,900],"css":{"display":"flex","dir":"row","bg":"rgb(248, 250, 252)"},"kids":[{"t":"aside","box":[0,0,240,900],"css":{"bg":"rgb(15, 23, 42)","pos":"sticky z30"},"kids":[{"t":"div","box":[0,0,239,64],"css":{"pad":"20px"},"kids":[{"t":"p","text":"exxat","box":[20,20,199,24],"css":{"fs":"16px","fw":"600","color":"rgb(255, 255, 255)","ls":"-0.4px"},"kids":[{"t":"span","text":"Prism","box":[63,23,42,18],"css":{"fs":"16px","fw":"600","color":"rgb(96, 165, 250)","ls":"-0.4px"}}]}]},{"t":"nav","box":[0,64,239,404],"css":{"pad":"0px 12px 16px"},"kids":[{"t":"div","box":[12,64,215,174],"kids":[{"t":"p","text":"Administrator","box":[12,64,215,24],"css":{"pad":"0px 8px 8px","fs":"12px","fw":"600","color":"rgb(100, 116, 139)","tt":"uppercase","ls":"0.3px"}},{"t":"button","text":"Overview","type":"submit","box":[12,88,215,36],"css":{"display":"flex","gap":"10px","dir":"row","ai":"center","pad":"8px 12px","fs":"14px","fw":"400","color":"rgb(203, 213, 